el and CISF have been deputed \nunder different Circ\nle offices for security to tourists at monuments as detailed in \nAnnexure.\n \n\nANNEXURE\n \n \nSTATEMENT REFERRED T\nO IN REPLY TO PART \n(c) & (d) \nOF THE LOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION N\nO. 156 FOR 04.02.201\n9\n \n \nDETAILS OF DEPLOYMENT OF SECURITY PERSONNEL AT VARIOUS \nMONUME\nNTS/SITES/MUSEUMS UNDER THE JURISDICTION OF ARCHAEOLOGICAL \nSURVEY OF INDIA\n \n \n \nSl.No.\n \nName of State\n \nCircle/Branch\n \nPrivate Security \nGuards\n \nCISF Pers.\n \nUn\n-\nArmed\n \nArmed\n \n1.\n \nUttar Pradesh\n \n \n \nAgra Circle\n \n138\n \n18\n \n279\n \nLucknow Circle\n \n56\n \n28\n \n-\n \nSarnath\n \n26\n \n19\n \n-\n \n2.\n \nMaharashtra\n \nAurangabad Circle\n \n121\n \n-\n \n-\n \nMumbai Circle\n \n137\n \n-\n \n-\n \n3.\n \nKarnataka\n \n \n \nBangalore Circle\n \n68\n \n32\n \n-\n \nDharwad Circle\n \n105\n \n38\n \n-\n \nHampi Mini Circle\n \n71\n \n15\n \n-\n \n4.\n \nMadhya Pradesh\n \nBhopal Circle\n \n141\n \n39\n \n-\n \n5.\n \nOdisha\n \nBhubaneswar \nCircle\n \n42\n \n29\n \n-\n \n6.\n \nWest Beng\nal, \nSikkim\n \nKolkata Circle\n \n52\n \n35\n \n-\n \n7.\n \nTamil Nadu, \nPuducherry\n \nChennai Circle\n \n39\n \n23\n \n-\n \n8.\n \nPunjab, Haryana\n \nChandigarh Circle\n \n03\n \n11\n \n-\n \n9.\n \nHimachal Pradesh\n \nShimla Circle\n \n04\n \n08\n \n-\n \n10.\n \nDelhi\n \nDelhi Circle\n \n292\n \n48\n \n317\n \n11.\n \nGoa\n \nGoa Circle\n \n24\n \n08\n \n-\n \n12.\n \nAssam\n \nGuwahati \nCircle\n \n21\n \n12\n \n-\n \n13\n \nMizoram\n \nAizawal Circle\n \n05\n \n-\n \n-\n \n14\n \nTripura\n \n17\n \n-\n \n-\n \n15\n \nRajasthan\n \nJaipur Circle\n \n16\n \n10\n \n-\n \nJodhpur Circle\n \n36\n \n20\n \n-\n \n16.\n \nAndhra Pradesh & \nTelangana\n \nHyderabad Circle\n \n78\n \n42\n \n-\n \n17.\n \nBihar\n \nPatna Circle\n \n70\n \n36\n \n-\n \n18.\n \nJammu & Kashmir\n \nSrinagar Circle\n \n-\n \n08\n \n-\n \nMini Circle Leh\n \n08\n \n-\n \n-\n \n19.\n \nKerala\n \nThrissur Circle\n \n